  "title": "David Perla co-authors article in Carrier Management and Insurance Journal calling for clarity—not confrontation—between the legal finance and insurance industries",
  "summary": "In an article entitled \"From Confusion to Collaboration,\" Burford Vice Chair David Perla and Parabellum Capital Managing Partner and Corporate Counsel Dai Wai Chin Feman co-author a piece for Carrier Management and Insurance Journal about how persistent misconceptions about claims costs and so-called \"social inflation\" highlight the need for clarity between insurers and the legal finance industry. Learn more.",
